# Vault PKI

## Defaults

1. Never invent role, issuer, or mount names.
2. Issue certificates only when the user asked; report serial/CN, not the
   private key, in chat.
3. Enabling mounts or deleting roles needs an explicit verb.
4. Prefer MCP PKI helpers over raw HTTP.
